he faithful word which is according to the teaching, that he may be able to exhort in the sound doctrine, and to convict those who contradict him."},{"verse":10,"text":"For there are also many unruly men, vain talkers and deceivers, especially those of the circumcision,"},{"verse":11,"text":"whose mouths must be stopped: men who overthrow whole houses, teaching things which they ought not, for dishonest gain’s sake."},{"verse":12,"text":"One of them, a prophet of their own, said, “Cretans are always liars, evil beasts, and idle gluttons.”"},{"verse":13,"text":"This testimony is true. For this cause, reprove them sharply, that they may be sound in the faith,"},{"verse":14,"text":"not paying attention to Jewish fables and commandments of men who turn away from the truth."},{"verse":15,"text":"To the pure, all things are pure, but to those who are defiled and unbelieving, nothing is pure; but both their mind and their conscience are defiled."},{"verse":16,"text":"They profess that they know God, but by their deeds they deny him, being abominable, disobedient, and unfit for any good work."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]